WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.186 --> 00:00:02.769
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:11.114
- Oakland really will chew you
up and spit you out like...

00:00:11.114 --> 00:00:13.088
like it's nothing, you know?

00:00:13.088 --> 00:00:15.146
People get killed every day.

00:00:15.146 --> 00:00:17.283
You know, living in Oakland,
nothing is promised tomorrow.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.450
So if I'm gone tomorrow, what
legacy would I leave behind?

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:27.253
My name is Tyrone Stevenson
also known as Baybe Champ,

00:00:27.253 --> 00:00:29.025
the Scraper Bike King,

00:00:29.025 --> 00:00:31.220
and I'm the founder
and CEO of the Original

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.720
Scraper Bike Team.

00:00:34.442 --> 00:00:36.751
- I ride because it's my lifestyle.

00:00:36.751 --> 00:00:39.843
- I don't know, it just
makes me express myself

00:00:39.843 --> 00:00:40.676
even more.

00:00:41.732 --> 00:00:45.251
- We work with youth that
lives in the community

00:00:45.251 --> 00:00:48.754
and teach them how to make their bicycles.

00:00:48.754 --> 00:00:51.838
For students, for kids
to be a part of the team,

00:00:51.838 --> 00:00:54.721
you have to have at least a 2.0 GPA.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.620
Some of them like it, some of them don't,

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.432
but at the end of the
day they have to respect

00:00:58.432 --> 00:01:01.312
it if they wanna be a part of this team.

00:01:01.312 --> 00:01:04.518
- We use different bike
parts to make one big one

00:01:04.518 --> 00:01:06.205
and make it look better.

00:01:06.205 --> 00:01:09.275
I can basically fix
anything on a bike now.

00:01:09.275 --> 00:01:14.072
- Scraper Bike Team teaches
youth how to customize

00:01:14.072 --> 00:01:16.998
their bikes, put aluminum
foil and duct tape

00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:21.165
and spray paint on the
bike, and make a nice bike.

00:01:22.087 --> 00:01:24.187
Scraper Bike is bigger
than this life, a regular

00:01:24.187 --> 00:01:26.974
bike is just a regular bike.

00:01:26.974 --> 00:01:30.563
- I ride Scraper Bike because
I like the way they look.

00:01:30.563 --> 00:01:34.730
- You get to show it off and
say you made it yourself.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:39.473
- Yesterday was our grand
opening of The Shed,

00:01:40.377 --> 00:01:43.460
the first youth brand bike shop ever

00:01:45.669 --> 00:01:46.586
in Oakland.

00:01:51.214 --> 00:01:54.947
I founded the Original
Scraper Bike Team officially

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:58.114
in 2007, yeah, me and my cousin Avery.

00:02:00.693 --> 00:02:02.620
It's a bittersweet feeling
to open up The Shed,

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:05.747
just knowing that my
cousin Avery isn't around.

00:02:05.747 --> 00:02:09.664
Just to see it, just to
have his presence here.

00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:14.517
Because he was killed, he was murdered.

00:02:18.829 --> 00:02:22.996
Senseless, he didn't have
nothing to do with nothing.

00:02:24.478 --> 00:02:28.645
I feel like this whole
movement is dedicated to him.

00:02:30.309 --> 00:02:33.557
And I do this because one
day I might not be here,

00:02:33.557 --> 00:02:37.724
and somebody else can step into
my place and keep it going.

00:02:38.742 --> 00:02:41.325
(upbeat music)

